"P1560968011" "Acid Black is quite simply a psychopath. He rules over a large group of the Destroyers with one part iron fist, ten parts insanity. Don't let his moments of calm fool you, he is a complete maniac. A calculative and intelligent negotiator one minute, a car hurling berserker the next."
