"P4052639549" "You took down Acid Black, one of the toughest Destroyers you have yet faced, and gathered some disturbing information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2269202976" "Jessica gives you a small recorder to tape any confessions you might get out of the Destroyers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2103043283" "Tell me you found something good. Oh, I can tell you found out something good.<br><br><color orange>Jessica reviews all of the recording you did in an almost catatonic state. When she's done it takes her awhile to say anything.</color><br><br>I... I can't believe this. This is AMAZING!<br><br><color orange>Unable to contain her joy she gives you a big hug and is all smiles.</color><br><br>Alright, I just have to do some last minute editing on my piece with these new facts, then I'm going to send a copy to TPN.<br><br>We're going to blow the doors right off their hinges, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2830609297" "{HeroName}, good to hear from you, Ms. Duncan and I were just talking about you."
// Answer Text :
"P4147197544" "(You sum up Jessica Flores' Destroyer story.)"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3722154605" "I see... Hold on.<br><br>... <br><br>... ...<br><br>{HeroName}, are you still there?"
// Answer Text :
"P1559188029" "I am, what do you want me to do?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1665765542" "Do as you have planned, this isn't worth blowing your cover over. Once this conversation is done I'll call up TPN and make sure they get their best people on this issue."
// Answer Text :
"P2934409594" "Are they going to stop it from airing?"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P3118307820" "TPN has the best spin doctors money can buy. I'm sure they'll find <i>some</i> way of turning a public relations nightmare into an award winning mini-series.<br><br>And if they can't, then they'll make sure it gets pulled off the air before anything catastrophic happens."
// Answer Text :
"P3477867889" "Alright, I'll maintain my cover."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P3977046453" "Good work, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1397400888" "Alright, {HeroName}, I finished the editing and had my boyfriend drop it into the TPN drop box. Don't worry, I used one of my pen names, <i>Tetrachloride</i>. I've used in the past.<br><br>Now, the only issue is that TPN sends all their footage to Athena Labs. They're going to edit everything out of my story over there.<br><br>So that's where I'm going to need your help again.<color orange>I need you to get into Athena Labs and make sure that my material skips the editing process.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1193830186" "Sneak into TPN for Jessica"
// SendOffString :
"P42200220" "Alright!<br><br>Here, this is the schedule for the security sweeps of the building. <color orange>My boyfriend knows a guy who can neutralize the surveillance systems remotely, but the security system will figure that out in a few minutes. Once you access the computers the Clockwork will be alerted to your tampering. If the security system detects an intruder, the PPD will be called. Their best response time is 2 minutes.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, you're going to have to move fast to get in and out of there unseen. I have faith in you though.<br><br><color yellow>Those Loyalists who are <i>truly</i> loyal to the safety and peace of Praetoria would do well to speak with Provost Marchand about events that are happening.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1611001825" "Manipulate Files in Athena Labs before PPD arrive"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1220336425" "I need you to get into Athena Labs before they edit my story. The editing process is automated, so if you move the necessary files out of the batch process into the editted folder then we're home free."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1725534963" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Edit Pass</color>"

